# Implementations of the extension point /TRBASE/ODATA_METADATA annotate
# the metadata of services: they add, change and remove annotations, add
# references to vocabularies and change descriptions. The kernel rejects
# changes of the structure and of the annotations it derives from business
# objects, such as Core.Computed and the capabilities.
public interface /TRBASE/ODATA_METADATA_EXTENSION

  # Returns the metadata with the changes of the implementation.
  method ADJUST(metadata: /TRBASE/ODATA_METADATA) returns /TRBASE/ODATA_METADATA

end
